{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":63322,"seasonNumber":3},"checkedAt":1793462646658,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":3,"name":{"value":"Stagione 3","language":"it-IT"},"year":2015,"episodeCount":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v5oTFfzZV2W2GyyNFsPU0U7lpl6.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1090115","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A space shuttle sent to the Moon has recovered parts of heretical technology as well as the body of Dr. Nastassja, but a collision with space debris threatens to send it crashing into a mountain. Will the Symphogear wielders be able to use their songs to stop the collision in time?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hlRRkFtAz7VyZXCRLfNyogHbj3A.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hlRRkFtAz7VyZXCRLfNyogHbj3A.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/3/episode/1"},{"id":"1092937","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A mysterious enemy has struck simultaneously in Japan and London, where Tsubasa is performing a concert. Their power is even greater than that of the Symphogears, and they want to destroy the entire world.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9BduuyL32FixM2XJsE5BI71n69n.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9BduuyL32FixM2XJsE5BI71n69n.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/3/episode/2"},{"id":"1092938","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Autoscorers destroy two of the Symphogears, disabling the team. Now only Hibiki is left, and she's refusing to fight.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xmN8zxigXUy1doHzu8MYinhCljo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xmN8zxigXUy1doHzu8MYinhCljo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"1092939","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With most of the Symphogears destroyed, it's up to Hibiki to fight the Autoscorers. But she's scared of hurting someone, and can't sing. Will she be able to find the will to fight?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2N9bKKSHheGn9FmjphiiN9XAdNq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2N9bKKSHheGn9FmjphiiN9XAdNq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"1092940","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Almost every Symphogear wielder's gear is destroyed, and it seems there's no one left who can fight back. Elfnein has a plan, but before it can be carried out the Autoscorers attack S.O.N.G headquarters! It's up to Kirika and Shirabe to save the day, and they can barely transform...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5Q6n2KC6LY2F2HaIs1ejYRLzMqG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Q6n2KC6LY2F2HaIs1ejYRLzMqG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/63322/season/3/episode/5"},{"id":"1093741","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":